Copyright 2026 gpui-material-symbols contributors

This project bundles unmodified Google Material Symbols variable fonts and
codepoint catalogs from google/material-design-icons, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The upstream license is preserved in assets/LICENSE. Exact source revision and
SHA-256 digests are recorded in assets/manifest.json.

The web build of the icon browser bundles IBM Plex Sans Regular, licensed
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (web/fonts/OFL.txt; source and SHA-256 in
web/fonts/SOURCES.json).

Material Symbols are a Google design resource. This project is an independent
integration for Longbridge GPUI Kit and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.
